# README - Missing Number Finder

## Aim
This folder contains a program to find the missing number in an array using bitwise XOR.

---

## Algorithm
1. Read the size of the array and its elements.
2. XOR all numbers from 0 to n-1 (or the relevant range).
3. XOR all array elements.
4. The remaining value is the missing number.

---

## How it works
The XOR of a number with itself becomes 0, so the duplicate values cancel out. The only value left after XORing all numbers and array elements is the missing number.

---

## Functionality
- Takes an array with one missing number
- Finds and prints the missing value

---

## Time and Space Complexity
- Time Complexity: O(n)
- Space Complexity: O(1)
